### Tables & Indexes Created

**V20260114 creates 6 tables:**
- `collections` - Curator-defined product groupings
- `product_collections` - Many-to-many join table
- `inventory_locations` - Physical/virtual storage facilities
- `inventory_adjustments` - Append-only audit log (PARTITIONED by month)
- `inventory_transfers` - Transfer batches between locations
- `inventory_transfer_lines` - Transfer line items

**V20260115 creates 6 RLS policies:**
- All tables protected with tenant isolation policies
- Both `ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY` and `FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY` applied

### Key Features

- ✅ All tables include `tenant_id` FK with `ON DELETE CASCADE`
- ✅ Unique constraints on natural keys per tenant
- ✅ Proper indexing for tenant-scoped queries (composite indexes with `tenant_id` first)
- ✅ Monthly partitions seeded for `inventory_adjustments` (2026-01 → 2026-03 + default)
- ✅ Optimistic locking via `version` columns
- ✅ CHECK constraints on status enums
